  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes its appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While exploring an underground store of immortal materials, Black Tigress asks whether it is the legendary secluded domain of heaven and earth, Hu Land, from The Legends of Ren Zu. Fairy Miao Yin says the two are mentioned together and compares it instead to Demon Immortal Qi Jue’s Xi Land.",
      "chapters": [
        2076
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_white_rabbit",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "loc_xi_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Southern Border region field because later cited scenes place the found Hu Land with Wu clan action in Southern Border. The legend is named without seating it on the five-region map.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Kong Sheng Tian’s will brings fugitives into a hall and states that his main body spent a hundred years tracking down Hu Land, a supreme qi path secluded domain that shares reputation with Xi Land. A translator note states Xi Land sucks in qi and Hu Land expels qi. As only a will, he can barely use Hu Land and cannot control direction or destination, and a mortal cannot take the secluded domain away.",
      "chapters": [
        2098
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "found-and-used-to-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_kong_sheng_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After he activates a killer move with Hu Land and the group scatters, a Wu Clan Gu Immortal finds Hu Land and reports it to Wu Yong. Wu Yong classes Hu Land with Xi Land as the qi path pair among secluded domains recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu, and resolves to obtain it in secret.",
      "chapters": [
        2099
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "found-and-used-to-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s messenger demands Hu Land from Wu Yong. Wu Ba Chong first denies that Wu clan holds the secluded domain, then treats it as comparable to a quasi-rank nine Immortal Gu when bargaining. Wu Yong agrees to sell it under pressure that Wu clan cannot keep it, and Hu Land is handed over with fan wind Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2134
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sold-to-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_wu_ba_chong",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_fan_wind_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan then gives Hu Land to Qi Sea Ancestor, who expects it to complete his combat system.",
      "chapters": [
        2135
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sold-to-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later fight, Hu Land appears above Qi Sea Ancestor as the core of qi path killer moves, and Demon Immortal Qi Jue notes that Xi Land absorbs while Hu Land specializes in releasing.",
      "chapters": [
        2191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sold-to-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
